Molly!

1892
01:53:25,597 --> 01:53:27,557
Just get away
from us, Carl.

1893
01:53:31,353 --> 01:53:32,228
Molly!

1894
01:53:32,354 --> 01:53:33,688
You're just a liar.

1895
01:53:33,772 --> 01:53:36,191
Listen to me.
This woman's a thief.

1896
01:53:36,274 --> 01:53:37,484
She's a con artist.

1897
01:53:37,567 --> 01:53:39,194
Why are you
doing this?

1898
01:53:39,277 --> 01:53:40,487
Don't listen to her.

1899
01:53:41,613 --> 01:53:42,614
Stop!

1900
01:53:42,739 --> 01:53:45,658
Just get away
from us, Carl.

1901
01:53:45,742 --> 01:53:47,243
I've called
the police.

1902
01:53:54,501 --> 01:53:55,710
Oh!

1903
01:53:56,836 --> 01:53:57,754
Shit.

1904
01:53:57,921 --> 01:53:59,255
Unh! Oh!

1905
01:54:00,298 --> 01:54:02,300
Why are you
doing this?

1906
01:54:02,425 --> 01:54:03,760
Don't interfere!
She's a thief!

1907
01:54:05,929 --> 01:54:08,181
All right.
Give me the check.

1908
01:54:08,264 --> 01:54:09,182
Carl, no!

1909
01:54:09,265 --> 01:54:10,600
Out of this, Molly!

1910
01:54:17,607 --> 01:54:20,151
Keep out of this,
Molly!

1911
01:54:20,318 --> 01:54:21,569
Give me the check!

1912
01:54:21,736 --> 01:54:23,196
Get off of me!

1913
01:54:27,742 --> 01:54:28,952
Where is it?

1914
01:54:29,244 --> 01:54:30,328
Where is it?

1915
01:54:30,453 --> 01:54:31,913
Where is it,
god damn it?

1916
01:54:32,038 --> 01:54:33,540
I gave it away.

1917
01:54:33,623 --> 01:54:34,624
You're lying.

1918
01:54:34,708 --> 01:54:38,253
Don't...lie to me,
god damn it!

1919
01:54:38,336 --> 01:54:39,004
[Click]

1920
01:54:40,296 --> 01:54:41,214
The check.

1921
01:54:54,394 --> 01:54:55,645
Watch out, Sam!

1922
01:54:55,812 --> 01:54:58,273
I swear to God
I'll kill her!

1923
01:55:03,486 --> 01:55:05,447
Now, just...

1924
01:55:05,530 --> 01:55:06,489
look.

1925
01:55:06,531 --> 01:55:08,992
Just give me
the check, Sam, OK?

1926
01:55:09,284 --> 01:55:11,786
I promise you
I'll let her go

1927
01:55:11,870 --> 01:55:14,664
if you just
give it to me. OK?

1928
01:55:16,416 --> 01:55:17,334
Sam?

1929
01:55:19,711 --> 01:55:20,628
Sam?

1930
01:56:03,380 --> 01:56:04,297
Aah!

1931
01:56:37,914 --> 01:56:38,873
Sam?

1932
01:56:41,751 --> 01:56:43,628
Oh, Carl.

1933
01:56:43,712 --> 01:56:44,629
What?

1934
01:56:59,769 --> 01:57:01,521
[Groaning]

1935
01:57:08,987 --> 01:57:10,447
What?

1936
01:57:14,409 --> 01:57:15,577
Aah!

1937
01:57:17,662 --> 01:57:19,080
Ooh! Help!

1938
01:57:23,835 --> 01:57:27,756
Aah!

1939
01:57:52,238 --> 01:57:54,032
Are you two all right?

1940
01:57:58,661 --> 01:57:59,579
Sam?

1941
01:58:02,540 --> 01:58:03,500
Molly?

1942
01:58:06,127 --> 01:58:07,629
I can hear you.

1943
01:58:44,624 --> 01:58:45,792
Oh, God.

1944
01:59:33,798 --> 01:59:35,550
Sam?

1945
01:59:35,633 --> 01:59:37,594
They're waiting
for you, Sam.

1946
01:59:49,022 --> 01:59:50,523
I'll miss you.

1947
01:59:52,192 --> 01:59:54,235
Your mother
would be proud.

1948
01:59:54,569 --> 01:59:57,864
I'm going to miss
you, too, Sam.

1949
01:59:57,947 --> 01:59:59,282
You're all right.

1950
02:00:01,242 --> 02:00:02,660
Bye, Oda Mae.

1951
02:00:04,579 --> 02:00:05,288
Bye, Sam.

1952
02:00:28,645 --> 02:00:29,938
I love you, Molly.

1953
02:00:32,649 --> 02:00:34,693
I've always
loved you.

1954
02:00:41,449 --> 02:00:42,325
Ditto.

1955
02:01:03,847 --> 02:01:05,181
It's amazing, Molly.

1956
02:01:06,850 --> 02:01:08,268
The love inside...

1957
02:01:08,393 --> 02:01:10,353
you take it
with you.

1958
02:01:22,407 --> 02:01:23,324
See ya.

1959
02:01:31,332 --> 02:01:32,250
See ya.

1960
02:01:51,728 --> 02:01:52,937
Bye.
